cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "paperacquire: polite, entitlement-respecting acquisition of scholarly full texts"
abstract: >-
  A tool for acquiring the full texts of scholarly articles for literature research.
  For each record it tries legal open-access copies first, then the channels the user is
  already entitled to (publisher APIs, the user's own institutional login in a real
  browser), then working-paper versions, with daily limits, randomized gaps and stop rules
  built in, and a title check on every PDF obtained from the network.
authors:
  - family-names: "Yuan"
    given-names: "Quan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3011-3739"
version: "0.6.0"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PadSama/paperacquire"
keywords:
  - full-text retrieval
  - literature review
  - systematic review
  - open access
  - research software
